# Spec §6.1. The row of a `pendiente` or `atrasada` task with a first step
# shows, on its own line, the step the task is on: «Primer paso: …» on
# step 1 and «Paso: …» on any other, never the whole list. If the task has two
# steps or more, that line has the buttons «Paso anterior» (not on step 1) and
# «Hecho». A one-step task looks like one with only a first step, without
# buttons.
# "the task row shows the step <text>" compares the exact text of the line,
# with its prefix. "the task row shows no first step" holds for both
# forms of the line («Primer paso: …» and «Paso: …»).
Feature: Steps in the row

  # Steps in the row 1
  # A one-step task looks as it does today: «Primer paso: …» and no buttons.
  Scenario Outline: Steps in the row 1
    Given a one-off task without a due date
    And the first step of the task is <first_step>
    When I query Pendientes at any moment
    Then the task row shows the step <text>
    And the task row shows no step buttons

    Examples:
      | first_step             | text                                |
      | Separar la ropa blanca | Primer paso: Separar la ropa blanca |

  # Steps in the row 2
  # With two steps or more, on step 1: «Primer paso: …» with «Hecho» and no «Paso
  # anterior».
  Scenario Outline: Steps in the row 2
    Given a one-off task without a due date
    And the steps of the task are <steps>
    When I query Pendientes at any moment
    Then the task row shows the step <text>
    And the task row shows the buttons <buttons>

    Examples:
      | steps                                       | text                                | buttons |
      | Separar la ropa blanca, Poner el lavarropas | Primer paso: Separar la ropa blanca | Hecho   |

  # Steps in the row 3
  # On another step: «Paso: …», with no number or total or the rest of the list, with
  # «Paso anterior» and «Hecho».
  Scenario Outline: Steps in the row 3
    Given a one-off task without a due date
    And the steps of the task are <steps>
    And the current step of the task is <current>
    When I query Pendientes at any moment
    Then the task row shows the step <text>
    And the task row shows the buttons <buttons>

    Examples:
      | steps                                                       | current | text                       | buttons               |
      | Separar la ropa blanca, Poner el lavarropas, Tender la ropa | 2      | Paso: Poner el lavarropas  | Paso anterior y Hecho |
      | Separar la ropa blanca, Poner el lavarropas, Tender la ropa | 3      | Paso: Tender la ropa       | Paso anterior y Hecho |

